        },
        {
          "text": "贵州遵义 · 湄潭",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN."
        },
        {
          "text": "园区景观",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "B."
        },
        {
          "text": "北山游步道西段 ·《费巩明灯》《桐油灯》雕塑",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN."
        },
        {
          "text": "现代实拍",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.figure__badge figure__badge--now"
        },
        {
          "text": "北山游步道西段，《费巩明灯》灯具与桌椅雕塑实拍。",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN."
        },
        {
          "text": "历史示意图",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.figure__badge figure__badge--then"
        },
        {
          "text": "铁皮罐油灯。",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN."
        },
        {
          "text": "浙大迁到遵义后，学生使用的植物油灯光线弱、油烟重。费巩用废弃的铁皮香烟罐设计灯身，加装玻璃罩，并在罐身开孔，自费订做八百多盏，送给学生。学生称它为“费巩灯”。",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "P."
        },
        {
          "text": "在湄潭办学期间，师生也使用桐油灯照明。园内另有《桐油灯》雕塑，记录当时的读书和生活条件。",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "P."
        },
        {
          "text": "查看桐油灯",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "BUTTON.ghost-btn"
        },
        {
          "text": "资料来源",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SUMMARY."
        },
        {
          "text": "S7",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__id"
        },
        {
          "text": "《西迁文化园雕塑介绍之费巩明灯》",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__title"
        },
        {
          "text": "浙江大学求是新闻网 · 2017-04-20",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__meta"
        },
        {
          "text": "S28",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__id"
        },
        {
          "text": "《费巩灯》（陈锡臣教授手绘示意图）",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__title"
        },
        {
          "text": "浙江大学求是新闻网 · 2015-01-30",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__meta"
        },
        {
          "text": "S27",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__id"
        },
        {
          "text": "《铭记西迁历史，打造浙大人精神家园》",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__title"
        },
        {
          "text": "浙江大学官网 · 2021-03-26",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__meta"
        },
        {
          "text": "S5",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__id"
        },
        {
          "text": "《浙江大学西迁文化园迎来首批客人》",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__title"
        },
        {
          "text": "浙江大学求是新闻网 · 2017-05-22",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__meta"
        },
        {
          "text": "R01",
          "size": 12,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__id"
        },
        {
          "text": "为心仪的西迁故事雕塑方案点赞",
          "size": 14,
          "selector": "SPAN.src-row__title"
        },
        {
          "text": "浙江大学 · 核对于 2026-11-08",
          "size": 12,
